{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the ring and fight your way through a mysterious dungeon to reclaim your boxing title!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this intense boxing roguelike, every battle tests your skill, strategy, and stamina as you face off against deadly opponents and uncover the dungeon\u2019s secrets. Unlock powerful weapons, develop unique abilities, and adapt your fighting style to overcome the challenges ahead. Battle through procedurally generated dungeon floors filled with dangerous foes and hidden mysteries. Equip diverse weapons, master special abilities, and customize your fighting style. Can you survive the dungeon gauntlet and reclaim your rightful place as champion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943790/extras/ddad75ef9e0762e03e8489858f49bbe6.poster.avif?t=1757166695\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943790/extras/ddad75ef9e0762e03e8489858f49bbe6.webm?t=1757166695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943790/extras/ddad75ef9e0762e03e8489858f49bbe6.mp4?t=1757166695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is a composition of the first floor of the full game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943790/extras/ff6ce62c63e5c1e5d43c673a86068f37.poster.avif?t=1757166695\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943790/extras/ff6ce62c63e5c1e5d43c673a86068f37.webm?t=1757166695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.aka